  meetLines:
  - thinking|Well, well. A new face on MY meadow?
  - laugh|This here's my farm pickup. And that's my hay bale launcher. Anything behind me gets a face full of hay!
  - smug|Beat me at Meadow Run and the launcher is yours. Not that you will, rookie.
  cardLine: My meadow, my rules. Try to keep up, rookie!
  startLines:
  - smug|My meadow, my rules. Try to keep up!
  - laugh|See you at the finish... if you get there.
  - smug|Mind the hay bales, rookie!
  winLines:
  - laugh|Back to the barn with you!
  - laugh|That's how we race on the farm!
  - wink|Eat my dust, rookie!
  loseLines:
  - angry|I let you win. Obviously.
  - angry|Hmph. Beginner's luck!
  - surprised|My tractor would have beaten you!
